EDUCATIONAL USE DISCLAIMER:

This software implements a simplified version of the Boneh-Franklin 
Identity-Based Encryption algorithm for educational purposes only. 
It is NOT intended for production use and has NOT undergone security audits.

The implementation contains deliberate simplifications that make it 
unsuitable for real-world cryptographic applications. Users should not 
rely on this software for actual security purposes.

For production cryptography, please use well-established, audited libraries 
and consult with cryptographic experts.
